NETCDF-BASED INITIALIZATION FILE (itypetraj = 3)
FOIL PATCH AND SUPER-INDIVIDUAL INITIAL CONDITIONS

Patch name
Patch initialization date (start of the trajectory)
Trajectory end date
Output interval
Input NetCDF file containing the initial particle positions
Output trajectory file
Number of particles released at each initial position
itypevert: initial vertical-movement scheme (may be updated later)
           = 0: constant depth (no vertical advection or turbulent diffusion)
           < 0: vertical advection only
           > 0: vertical advection and turbulent diffusion using a random walk
Species name (anchovy or sardine)
Developmental stage of the individuals
Individual length
Number of individuals represented by each particle (super-individual abundance)
Individual density
Individual age
Individual age class
Maturity energy
Reserve energy
Energy allocated to reproduction (first-feeding model; Nisbet, 2012)
Energy allocated to gametes

END OF FILE DESCRIPTION%

